00:46:59.290 --> 00:47:27.750
<v Sean Cole>These days in Las Vegas, each and every officer involved shooting is investigated by no fewer than five committees. Assistant Sheriff Primas told us that on one of the committees the civilian members-- that is, people like you and me-- can actually outvote four to three the police members on what direction an investigation should go in. And as a result of all of this, officers who are involved in unjustified shootings are punished more than they were before. And by more than before, I mean they weren't before.
<v Sean Cole>如今在拉斯维加斯，每一桩警察涉案枪击事件都由不少于五个委员会调查。助理警长普里马斯告诉我们，其中一个委员会的平民成员——也就是说，像你我这样的人——实际上可以在调查方向上以四比三的投票结果战胜警察成员。作为所有这一切的结果，那些卷入不正当枪击事件的警官受到的惩罚比以前更多了。说到“比以前多”，我的意思是以前根本就没有惩罚。

