00:47:57.540 --> 00:48:15.300
<v Sean Cole>And all of these solutions, they worked. Last year, there were zero unjustified shootings by police in Las Vegas. And all of these solutions, they worked. Last year, there were zero unjustified shootings by police in Las Vegas.
<v Sean Cole>而所有这些解决方案，它们都奏效了。去年，拉斯维加斯发生的警察不正当枪击事件为零。所有这些解决方案，它们都奏效了。去年，拉斯维加斯发生的警察不正当枪击事件为零。

